[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2653.43, "timestamp": "00:44:13", "text": "。  是的。是的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2654.348, "timestamp": "00:44:14", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "well u don't know the full context soo it's stupid to think about it"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2662.15, "timestamp": "00:44:22", "text": "。沒錯，沒錯，沒錯"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2663.02, "timestamp": "00:44:23", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i used to be a naive fellow when i started watching INvtubers \"wow, there's no drama here\""}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2668.253, "timestamp": "00:44:28", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "most people giving their opinion on this just want attention"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2668.706, "timestamp": "00:44:28", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "and then there was drama"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2670.95, "timestamp": "00:44:30", "text": "。但即便如此，你知道，我看到的還是一個孤單一人的土著。哇。這裡沒什麼戲劇性的。然後就發生了戲劇性的事情。我的意思是，你知道，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2684.091, "timestamp": "00:44:44", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "and then i finally got to know, drama is everywhere"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2684.79, "timestamp": "00:44:44", "text": "當時發生了很多戲劇性的事情。從某種意義上說，我已經基本上脫離了IMV社群。更確切地說，我停止了志願活動和所有那些事情，因為我對一切都感到厭倦了。我厭倦了一切。  [音樂] 嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2689.95, "timestamp": "00:44:49", "text": "我想要的只是一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2693.87, "timestamp": "00:44:53", "text": "社區，每個人都可以友好相處，但並不是每個人都想法一致"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2698.55, "timestamp": "00:44:58", "text": "。人們都在想著自己的私事，"}]